{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01341",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.83,
      "end_seconds": 6.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "Good evening, uh, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.87,
      "end_seconds": 12.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.35,
      "end_seconds": 22.28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.93,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got a painful band of blisters on the left side of my chest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.32,
      "end_seconds": 26.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "So, has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.09,
      "end_seconds": 30.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "I've had it for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.99,
      "end_seconds": 40.59,
      "duration_seconds": 9.6,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.1,
      "end_seconds": 50.23,
      "duration_seconds": 9.13,
      "text": "So, it happens a few times a day. It's worse with clothing rubbing. Cool cloths helps a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.23,
      "end_seconds": 57.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Have you had itching?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.79,
      "end_seconds": 66.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "Yes, that started yesterday. Oh, about itching, I'd say on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.26,
      "end_seconds": 79.14,
      "duration_seconds": 10.88,
      "text": "have you had a painful band of blisters on the left side of your chest before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.06,
      "end_seconds": 86.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "A bit, last winter. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.6,
      "end_seconds": 94.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Right, do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.97,
      "end_seconds": 100.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.45,
      "text": "Ah, you know, no, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.54,
      "end_seconds": 103.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.84,
      "end_seconds": 108.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "I swim twice a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.52,
      "end_seconds": 112.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.5,
      "end_seconds": 121.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.42,
      "end_seconds": 141.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.57,
      "end_seconds": 147.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Hmm, no, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.6,
      "end_seconds": 159.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.38,
      "end_seconds": 168.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "just a varicose vein procedure, last year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.15,
      "end_seconds": 173.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.13,
      "end_seconds": 180.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Let me think, my aunt has rheumatoid arthritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.75,
      "end_seconds": 186.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.55,
      "end_seconds": 189.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "no known allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.06,
      "end_seconds": 192.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "what about rash on the face?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.88,
      "end_seconds": 198.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any rash on the face"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.94,
      "end_seconds": 206.65,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "Have you noticed rash on the other side, immune problems, eye pain or blurred vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.25,
      "end_seconds": 210.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.01,
      "end_seconds": 215.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.05,
      "end_seconds": 219.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.36,
      "end_seconds": 222.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.04,
      "end_seconds": 234.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.4,
      "end_seconds": 251.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.11,
      "text": "okay: saturation 99 percent, pressure 111 over 72. And heart rate 79, temperature is 36.6 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.6,
      "end_seconds": 254.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.71,
      "end_seconds": 259.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.46,
      "end_seconds": 263.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.71,
      "end_seconds": 265.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "of course"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.83,
      "end_seconds": 269.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.71,
      "end_seconds": 283.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "Grouped blisters on a red base along one rib on the left, not crossing the midline."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.98,
      "end_seconds": 304.49,
      "duration_seconds": 16.51,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Taking everything into account, my working impression is shingles. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. Another possibility is an insect-bite reaction."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.76,
      "end_seconds": 310.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Ah, um, what are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.2,
      "end_seconds": 317.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's shingles, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.3,
      "end_seconds": 342.75,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Keep the blisters clean and covered, and avoid contact with anyone pregnant or newborn until they crust."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.14,
      "end_seconds": 352.9,
      "duration_seconds": 9.76,
      "text": "Right, right. We'll catch up in two weeks. Okay, before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.2,
      "end_seconds": 359.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "So, I come back in two weeks. Is that that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.21,
      "end_seconds": 367.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.28,
      "end_seconds": 373.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}